{
  "name": "@vssaros/dsh-agents",
  "version": "0.2.354",
  "description": "VsSaros Bots module for DeepSeek Harness: registers ~/.vssaros/agents/<id>/.agent.md (built-in and custom roots) as dsh agent presets with persona and per-session model selection; persona hot switching and lifecycle tools (agent_list / agent_open_session / agent_switch_persona / agent_stop / agent_message / agent_read_chat); assignment runtime with a durable ledger; IM channels (Feishu / Telegram / Discord / WeCom) with a durable outbox; multi-bot group chats (lib/rooms.js: group_relay, member shadow sessions, agent-rooms.json with a single-writer lease); cross-plugin team bus (Symbol.for('vssaros.team')). Version history: CHANGELOG.md.",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT AND Apache-2.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
